{"t":"Darkfield","s":"darkfield-48253","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Darkfield_291995.gif","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Go Forward Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"25\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Go_Forward_Icon_f12cec.png\" width=\"25\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">See also:</p><br/><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Agony%20Damage\">Agony Damage</a> and Agony</p></div><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Darkfield</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Darkfield\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Darkfield_291995.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Magical Effects<br/>Fields</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lightcolor\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Light</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ff0033; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span><span style=\"margin: 0 0 0 0.4em;\">3 sqm</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">13.20.13560<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 10, 2023<br/>Summer Update 2023</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20230614210811&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Darkfield_291995.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  darkfield.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Darklight%20Core\">Darklight Core</a>, boss rooms of <a href=\"#/wiki/Chagorz\">Chagorz</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Bakragore\">Bakragore</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>On <a href=\"#/wiki/Darklight%20Core\">Darklight Core</a>, its most important characteristic is that it gives the player the Agony <a href=\"#/wiki/Special%20Conditions\">Special Condition</a> when stepped on, which takes 2% of the character's maximum health per second for 11 seconds as <a href=\"#/wiki/Agony%20Damage\">Agony Damage</a> that cannot be mitigated. The Darkfield can be destroyed using <a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field%20Rune\">Destroy Field Runes</a>. However, it cannot be destroyed by throwing another type of field, <a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Wall\">Magic Walls</a> or Wild Growths on it. It lasts for 70 seconds.\n</p><p>On the boss rooms of <a href=\"#/wiki/Chagorz\">Chagorz</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Bakragore\">Bakragore</a>, it exists as players tracks, dealing a percentage of a character's maximum HP per second as <a href=\"#/wiki/Agony%20Damage\">Agony Damage</a> and also healing the bosses when stepping on it.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>On May 20, 2025, the patch fixed a bug where it could deal double damage on <a href=\"#/wiki/Bakragore\">Bakragore</a>'s room.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Agony</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bakragore\">Bakragore</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Chagorz\">Chagorz</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Darklight%20Field\">Darklight Field</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Darklight%20Spark\">Darklight Spark</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field%20Rune\">Destroy Field Rune</a></li><li>Fields</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire\">Fire</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Wall%20Rune\">Magic Wall Rune</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Gas\">Poison Gas</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/rotten-blood-quest\">Rotten Blood Quest</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["decaying-defender-outfits-quest","rotten-blood-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"rotten-blood-quest","quest":"Rotten Blood Quest","step":"4-1","n":29,"title":"Cuidado com os Darkfields","kind":"mention","coords":[]},{"slug":"rotten-blood-quest","quest":"Rotten Blood Quest","step":"5-4","n":42,"title":"Controlar o teu contador de cargas","kind":"mention","coords":[]},{"slug":"rotten-blood-quest","quest":"Rotten Blood Quest","step":"7-2","n":59,"title":"Controlar o teu contador de cargas","kind":"mention","coords":[]}]}}